<title>JAPAN: Asahi Breweries to boost production of canned beer.</title>
<headline>Asahi Breweries to boost production of canned beer.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asahi Breweries Ltd said on Friday that it plans to boost its production capacity of canned beer by 20 percent before June in response to growing sales.</p>
<p>An Asahi spokesman said that the company would raise annual production capacity of canned beer to 3.6 billion cans.</p>
</text>
